<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">NAKUM</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Nakum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nakum</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">NAKUM</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Nakum </char> obedo wayu me lwod me pwoyo poto pa Nineve, ma en taun madit pa jo Aciria, mayam con ki con obedo lamone ma unu jo Icrael. Poto pa Nineve kineno ni obedo pwod madit ma Lubanga otimo ikomgi pi bedo jo mager ma timgi racu ikom rok mukene. Man otime i kine me mwaka miya abicel ki pyere abicel wiye adek ki mwaka miya abicel ki apar wiye aryo ma peya kinywalo Yecu, ikare me loc pa rwot Yocia.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop ikom Nineve <char style="ior"><ref loc="NAM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Poto pa Nineve <char style="ior"><ref loc="NAM 2:1-3:19">2:1—3:19</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NAM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1—3:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:5-34">Ica 10:5-34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">14:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Jep 2:13-15</ref></char>
    </note>Man lok me nebi ma kicoyo ma okemo Nineve, ma Lubanga onyutu bot Nakum, dano me Elkoc.<verse eid="NAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiniga omako Rwot ikom Nineve</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 1:2" />Rwot en Lubanga ma lanyeko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:2">dok en miyo pwod bot jo ma pe wore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:2">Rwot culu kwor kun tye ki akemo madwong;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:2">Rwot culu kwor ikom lukwore dok kano akemone pi jo ma gin lumonene.<verse eid="NAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 1:3" />Rwot kiniga pe mako oyot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">ento en tye ki tek madwong tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">dok pe kwanyo kope woko ki ikom lubalo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NAM 1:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">Yoo me wote tye i yamo lapiru ki i yamo kot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">pol obedo apwa me kor tyene.<verse eid="NAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 1:4" />En juku nam, ci piine dwon woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">en miyo pii ma i kulu ducu dwon woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">Olet ma i Bacan two woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">lum ma iwi got Karmel ner dok boke woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">ki ature me Lebanon bene ner woko.<verse eid="NAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 1:5" />Godi ducu yenge inyim Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:5">cere gileny inyime.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:5">Lobo yenge inyim Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:5">lobo ki jo ducu ma gibedo iye komgi myel.<verse eid="NAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 1:6" />Kace akemo omako Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">anga matwero cung inyime?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">Anga matwero ciro kinigane malyeti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">En onyo akemone calo mac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">dok muku gweng, ngido woko matinotino.<verse eid="NAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 1:7" />Rwot gire ber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:7">en aye kakane pa jone ikare me can;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:7">dok en gwoko jo ma giringo gilaro bote.<verse eid="NAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 1:8" />Rwot jwero lukwore</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:8">calo lalele me pii ma mol ki teko madwong tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:8">dok ryemo lumonene naka wa i colpiny.<verse eid="NAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 1:9" />Wun wutye kapiro kit lok ango ikom Rwot?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:9">En bityekowu woko liweng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:9">pe mite ni en ocul kwor kiryo ikom wun lukwore</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:9">dong en bigoyo wun tyen kicel keken.<verse eid="NAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 1:10" />Lukwore bibedo macalo okutu ma okade woko liking, ci gibicato calo lumero ma gumato kongo bwino mapol.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:10">Ci kibiwangogi woko macalo reng kal ma otwo.<verse eid="NAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 1:11" />Wun jo Nineve, dano mo nene oa ki ikinwu, ma ceng opiro lok marac ikom Rwot, dok omiyo tam marac bot jo mukene.<verse eid="NAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 1:12" />Rwot waco bot jone jo Icrael kuman ni, “Kadi bed jo Aciria gitek ma gidwong ningo, kibityekogi woko, dok nyinggi birwenyo woko matwal. Kadi bed yam aunuwu, pe dok abiunuwu aye. <verse eid="NAM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 1:13" />Kombedi dong abituru okol ma jo Aciria gurwako i ngutwu ci abicodo nyor ma gutweyo kwede tyenwu bene.”<verse eid="NAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 1:14" />Man aye cik ma Rwot oketo pi jo Aciria: “Nyingwu pe dok biwinye matwal. Abijwero cal jogi apayawu woko liweng nyo cal jogi ma kicweyo ki i ot pa lubangawu, abiweko kineko wun woko ci abikwinyo bur lyel me yikowu, pien konywu dong peke. Wun pe opore me bedo kwo!”<verse eid="NAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:7">Ica 52:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kong wunen, tyen ngat makelo lok maber tye iwi godi en tucu lok me kuc. Wun jo Juda, wukwer nino madito, dok wucob kwongwu, pien jo maracu pe dok gibimede kamonyowu, pien dong kijwerogi woko matwal.<verse eid="NAM 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Poto pa Nineve</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 2:1" />Nineve, nen lanek piny tye kabino ikomwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:1">Wugwok cel me gang maber; wubed kaneno yoo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:1">wutwe pyerwu ki del;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:1">wubed ma dong bene wuyubu monywu pi lweny.<verse eid="NAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 2:2" />(Rwot dong tye kadwoko deyo ki woro pa Yakobo ma en aye deyo ki woro me dit pa Icrael, macalo ikare ma luyak onongo peya oyako jamigi.)<verse eid="NAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 2:3" />Lumerokgi ma gin twoni oteka lweny gumako kwot ma obok i cinggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">acikarine ducu bene guruku bongo makwar.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">Gadigadi lwenygi mil meny calo leb mac dok kiryeyogi i tyeng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">aguragura lwenygi dong gitye atera mada.<verse eid="NAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 2:4" />Gadigadi lwenygi giringo ata idye yoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:4">gimwome ki ngwec tungi ki tungi idyekal me gang;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:4">gimeny lipilpil calo mac raa idye gudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:4">gibedo kamil amila calo lutkot.<verse eid="NAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 2:5" />Dong kityeko lwongo ludito ma giloyo lulweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:5">gin dong gipange apanga ki wot me cito anyim.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NAM 2:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:5">Jo ma omonyogi girune gicito ikom cel gogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:5">ma gumako kwot me lageng komgi.<verse eid="NAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 2:6" />Dogcel ducu ma i dog kulu dong kiyabogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:6">gangkal pa rwot opong ki lworo.<verse eid="NAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 2:7" />Cal jok apayagi ma en dakeri bene kitero woko i opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:7">dok angecane bene gitye kakok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:7">ma gikumu akuma calo amam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:7">ma gidongo korgi ki cwercwiny.<verse eid="NAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 2:8" />Dano bia ki ngwec madwir ki i Nineve macalo pii dam ma omuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:8">ma piine mol liyekyek cito woko liweng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:8">Ludito me gang gibidange bot lukur piny ni, “Wucung ba! Wucung ba!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:8">Ento pe tye ngat mo ikin gi ma biloke dwogo cen ki ikin lwak ma giringo.<verse eid="NAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 2:9" />Lukwor ma olwenyo ikomgi biwaco bot lukwor luwotgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:9">“Wuyak ryal!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:9">wuyak jabugu bene!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:9">Lonyo ma kikano dwong ma pe tum i taun madit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:9">ki jami me wel mabeco ma yomo cwiny dano tye ma pe kwane.”<verse eid="NAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 2:10" />Nineve dong kijwero woko odong obur!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:10">Cwinygi poto kun conggi myel amyela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:10">arem dong omako dano ducu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:10">wanggi ducu olwal woko!<verse eid="NAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 2:11" />Dong taun madit man me Nineve ma obedo calo boro pa labwor tye kwene kaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:11">En ma nene obedo calo ka kano cam pa lutino labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:11">kama yam labwor tero iye lee ma omako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:11">kama ceng lutinone bedo iye labongo ngat mo ma yelogi.<verse eid="NAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 2:12" />Lumony ma i Nineve gubedo calo labwor ma gimako lee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:12">ci gikilogi woko matinotino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:12">kun gipongo boro ki ringo lee ma gumakoni pi megi labwor ki pi lutinogi.<verse eid="NAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 2:13" />Rwot me mony matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Nen, an abedo lakworwu, abiwango gadigadi lwenywu woko ducu, ci yitone biduny. Dok pala lucwan bene bityeko mony mewu woko liweng; ki dwon lukwenani bene dong pe biwinye matwal pi cwalo kwena mo bot rok mapat ni gumine kengi i te loc mewu.”<verse eid="NAM 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NAM 3" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 3:1" />Can bipoto ikom taun madit ma oyo remo pa dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:1">ma opong ki goba ki jami ma kiyako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:1">ma tim me yak pe gik ki iye ni!<verse eid="NAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 3:2" />Kong wuwiny kit ma del anino cot kwede, ki mor pa lawala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:2">kit ma aguragura pye kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:2">kacel ki mor pa gadigadi ma giringo.<verse eid="NAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 3:3" />Kong inen kit ma wegi aguragura gitye kangwec kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">ma nongo pala lucwangi meny amenya lipilpil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">ki tongigi bene ryeny aryenya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">Lwak dano ma kineko, komgi odure lipim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">dano ma oto welgi pe kwane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">dano woto ma giyoke ayoka ki kom jo ma oto!<verse eid="NAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 3:4" />Nineve ma twon lakweleni dong kitye kapwodone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:4">en yomo cwiny co ki time me yatyat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:4">en aye makelo can ikom rok mapol pi time me kwele kweleni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:4">dok rwenyo jo mapol ki time me yatyat.<verse eid="NAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 3:5" />Rwot me mony owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">“Nen, an dong abipwodo in Nineve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">abiwalo wa bongoni woko ki i pyeri aumu ki wii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">abimiyo lurok gineni ma dong itye munero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">ci lewic bimaki pien ker ducu bineni.<verse eid="NAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 3:6" />Abinywano komi ki gin me kwer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:6">dok abitimo tim me cac ikomi wek rok gunge kit ma acayi kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:6">abimiyo dano giciko wanggi ikomi ki wur.<verse eid="NAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 3:7" />Jo ducu ma bineni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">gibijer woko ki boti kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">‘Nineve odong obur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">anga mono ma bikumu pire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">En binongo jo ma kweyo cwinye ki kwene?’”<verse eid="NAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 3:8" />Nineve in mono itamo ni iber ma ikato Tebec? Ma yam onongo taun madit matye inget kulu Nail, ma pii Nail orumu woko dyere, kun gwoke macalo cel mere. <verse eid="NAM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 3:9" />En yam oloyo Etiopia ki Ejipt, tekone onongo peke; Put ki Libya bene yam gubedo kakonyo en. <verse eid="NAM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 3:10" />Kadi bed kumeno, jo Tebec yam kiterogi woko, kiterogi woko i opii. Lutinone ducu kinekogi woko i agakigaki yoo; dok kibolo bene kwir pi luditogi ma giworo, jo madito ducu kitweyogi woko ki nyor.<verse eid="NAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 3:11" />Nineve, in bene ibimer, dok ibibange woko; in bene ibiyenyo kapuce ki i cing lukwori. <verse eid="NAM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 3:12" />Cel gogoni ducu bibedo macalo yat oduru ma nyige pud cek aceka, ma ka kiyengo yate ci nyige poto piny i dog jo ma camo.<verse eid="NAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 3:13" />Nen, lulwenyi girom ki mon mamwa. Dogcel me loboni kiyabo malac inyim lukwori, mac dong biwango rii me dog celi woko. <verse eid="NAM 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 3:14" />Twom piini, dok iyub celi obed matek, lukwori gibibino girumi woko; pye i bur lobo inyon lobo, mak bao igo matapwali! <verse eid="NAM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 3:15" />Mac biwangi woko ki kunu, pala lucwan bene bitongi woko, kibityekowu macalo bonyo tyeko kwede cam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NAM 3:15">Wunya wumede giwu calo bonyo. <verse eid="NAM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NAM 3:16" />Wumedo lucatwilwu dong gudoko mapol ma gikato lakalatwe ma i polo. Ento gin birweny ata macalo bonyo, ma yaro bwome, ci tuk cito woko. <verse eid="NAM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NAM 3:17" />Rwodiwu dong gipol macalo ocene, lulocwu bene gidwong calo lwak bonyo ma gicore iwi cel ikare ma koyo ngic. Ka ceng dong otuc, ci gituk gicito woko; ngat mo ma ngeyo kama gucito iye bene peke.<verse eid="NAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NAM 3:18" />In rwot me Aciria, lukwat guto woko, wa luditoni me awora bene dong gunino woko matwal. Lwaki guket woko ata iwi godi, ngat mo maromo cokogi kacel peke. <verse eid="NAM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NAM 3:19" />Ret ma kiketo ikomi pe twero cang, wang bure odet marac tutwal. Jo ducu ma giwinyo lok ma ikomi gidongo cinggi ki yomcwiny pi gin ma otime ikomi. Tika ngat mo tye ma obwot ki itim bwamini ma onongo itiyo ma pe giki?<verse eid="NAM 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 3" />
</usx>